node_modules

# Output
.output
.vercel
.netlify
.wrangler
/.svelte-kit

# /build is NOT ignored, unlike a normal SvelteKit project: go:embed
# needs it present at compile time, and nothing yet rebuilds it as part
# of `go build`/`go test` or CI (alrayyes/hush-hush#208 wires a real
# frontend build stage into Dockerfile; the plain `go test`/lint CI job
# still has no such step). Until then this stays committed, same as the
# placeholder it replaces - run `bun run build` before committing a
# frontend change so it doesn't go stale relative to src/.

# The changelog page's own source: copied fresh from the repo root by
# `bun run dev`/`build` (the "copy-changelog" script) every time, so a
# committed copy here would just be a second one to drift out of sync.
/static/CHANGELOG.md

